# Gradle Wrapper JAR
# This is a placeholder file for the gradle-wrapper.jar
# The actual JAR will be downloaded when you first run ./gradlew
# 
# To download the wrapper JAR manually:
# 1. Run: ./gradlew wrapper
# 2. Or download from: https://services.gradle.org/distributions/
#
# The gradle-wrapper.jar is required for GitHub Actions to work properly